            "column_placement": "left",
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<p>Vael candle sand is crafted from <strong>plant-based vegan wax</strong>, designed to burn cleanly with minimal smoke or soot. Made from sustainably sourced and purified ingredients, it is free from paraffin, soy, and common allergens. Our unscented candle sand offers a neutral base for personalizing with your favorite <strong>phthalate-free fragrances</strong>.</p>",
