          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "column_placement": "left",
            "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<p><strong>Q: Is Vael Candle Sand scented?</strong><br/>A: No, our candle sand is unscented, allowing you to add your own essential or fragrance oils before lighting to create a personalized aroma. Always do this before igniting the candle for safety.</p><p><strong>Q: Is it safe for pets?</strong><br/>A: Yes, it is made from non-toxic, plant-based ingredients. However, we recommend keeping it out of reach of pets, especially when lit.</p><p><strong>Q: Can I reuse the wicks?</strong><br/>A: Absolutely! The cotton wicks provided are reusable. Simply trim the wick or flip it to use the unburnt portion, and refresh your setup whenever needed.</p><p><strong>Q: What is candle sand made of?</strong><br/>A: It is crafted from sustainably sourced, plant-based materials, free from paraffin, parabens, and artificial additives, ensuring a clean and eco-friendly burn.</p><p><strong>Q: Do I need special containers?</strong><br/>A: Not at all! Any heat-resistant container works — bowls, jars, glasses, vases — match your style.</p>",
            "page_for_content": "",
